We are given that $ |S| \geq 2018 $ and $ |T| \geq 2018 $. The projections of these sets onto the coordinate planes satisfy $ |S| + |T| \leq n^2 $, $ |S| + |T| \leq n^2 $, and $ |S| + |T| \leq n^2 $. Since $ |S| $ and $ |T| $ are each at least 2018, we deduce $ n^2 \geq 2 \times 2018 $, leading to $ n \geq \sqrt{4036} \approx 63.56 $. The minimal integer value of $ n $ satisfying this inequality is 64.
